### Talk: Matteo Zanaroli

(Friday 16 October, Closing Plenary: EOSC Federation: What's next)

![Slides][slides-icon] [Slides](link)

![MoU for HORIZON-INFRA-2025-01-EOSC-01 projects](slides/zanaroli_mou_horizon_infra_eosc.jpg)

* A Memorandum of Understanding aligning EU-funded projects behind one EOSC Federation
* Projects involved: EOSC Association (coordinator of EOSC Gravity and EOSC United), EOSC4ALL, EOSC-CONNECT, EOSC-Marine and EOSC Mesh
* Subjects covered: federation architecture (common standards and a joint roadmap), governance (aligned with the Federation's interim governance), engagement (a joint plan aligning node, country and community outreach) and sustainability (shared best practices and exploitable results)
* Added value: greater impact than any single project, seamless interoperability, one architecture roadmap, less duplication of engagement and sustainability work, and quarterly coordination across technical, governance, engagement and sustainability topics

  **=>** The MoU signature was scheduled for the EOSC Symposium itself.



